Predicts this component's activation from four readable cues:
1. A document that opens with "Title:" (a metadata header): the colon gets a large value.
2. "Assignment Help" (homework-help ad text): the "Help" gets a large negative value.
3. Inside `using` / `import` lines: well-known library names (std, System.Threading.Tasks,
   java.util.List/Map/Set/Date) are positive; other package-path segments are mildly negative.
4. The first token of a document: a capitalised word without a leading space is mildly
   negative, punctuation or lowercase-without-space slightly so; everything else is 0.
